{"seq":2,"slug":"force-compliant-locomotion","title":"力控与柔顺运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/force-compliant-locomotion","wordCount":1845,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"力控与柔顺运动\">力控与柔顺运动</h1><p>当一台四足的脚以每秒数次的频率砸向未知地面，它需要的不是&quot;精确到达某个位置&quot;，而是&quot;用恰当的力踩下去，遇硬就稳住、遇软就让一让&quot;。位置控制在刚性接触世界里会被冲击撕裂——脚还没到规划位置就撞上石头，硬要追位置就会弹飞或折损关节。力控与柔顺运动让机器人学会调节&quot;施力&quot;而非&quot;到位&quot;。本篇专讲接触力如何被控制与塑形；这些力的来源（MPC 解出的期望接触力）见 <a href=\"whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a>，硬件前提（准直驱、SEA）见 <a href=\"../legged/leg-mechanisms-gait\">腿足机构与步态</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>控制范式的根本选择是控位置还是控力。纯位置控制在自由空间精确，但一接触刚性环境就会因微小位置误差产生巨大接触力。纯力控在接触时柔顺，却在自由空间无从约束位置。<strong>柔顺控制</strong>调和二者：不直接命令位置或力，而是规定二者之间的动态关系——本质是让末端表现得像一套可调的弹簧-质量-阻尼系统。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[控制范式] --&gt; B[位置控制&lt;br/&gt;自由空间精确 接触刚硬]&#10;  A --&gt; C[力控制&lt;br/&gt;接触柔顺 位置无约束]&#10;  A --&gt; D[柔顺控制&lt;br/&gt;规定力-位置动态关系]&#10;  D --&gt; E[阻抗控制&lt;br/&gt;位置输入→力输出]&#10;  D --&gt; F[导纳控制&lt;br/&gt;力输入→位置输出]&#10;  E --&gt; G[落地缓冲 / 抗冲击]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[控制范式] --&gt; B[位置控制&lt;br/&gt;自由空间精确 接触刚硬]\n  A --&gt; C[力控制&lt;br/&gt;接触柔顺 位置无约束]\n  A --&gt; D[柔顺控制&lt;br/&gt;规定力-位置动态关系]\n  D --&gt; E[阻抗控制&lt;br/&gt;位置输入→力输出]\n  D --&gt; F[导纳控制&lt;br/&gt;力输入→位置输出]\n  E --&gt; G[落地缓冲 / 抗冲击]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>下表对比阻抗与导纳控制，这是力控里最常被混淆的一对。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>阻抗控制</th>\n<th>导纳控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>因果方向</td>\n<td>测位置偏差 → 输出力</td>\n<td>测外力 → 输出位置修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合环境</td>\n<td>刚性接触</td>\n<td>柔软/受限接触</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对驱动要求</td>\n<td>高透明度（可反驱）</td>\n<td>高刚度位置内环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>腿足典型用途</td>\n<td>落地缓冲、足端力跟踪</td>\n<td>力引导、人机协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阻抗与导纳-一枚硬币的两面\">阻抗与导纳：一枚硬币的两面</h2><p><strong>阻抗控制</strong>把末端建模成一套虚拟弹簧-阻尼-惯量，给定期望位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{x}_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5944em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，输出力按偏差生成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>¨</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{F} = M_d(\\ddot{\\boldsymbol{x}}_d - \\ddot{\\boldsymbol{x}}) + D_d(\\dot{\\boldsymbol{x}}_d - \\dot{\\boldsymbol{x}}) + K_d(\\boldsymbol{x}_d - \\boldsymbol{x})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1597em;\">F</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6813em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">x</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_d, D_d, K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是期望的虚拟惯量、阻尼、刚度。调低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 末端就&quot;软&quot;，落地冲击被弹簧吸收；调高就&quot;硬&quot;，跟踪精确。它以位置为输入、力为输出，需要关节高度可反驱（准直驱的优势所在）。<strong>导纳控制</strong>则因果相反：测量外力，按虚拟动力学算出该让出的位置，再交给一个高刚度位置内环执行，适合本身刚硬、难以反驱的工业关节。两者描述同一物理关系，只是把谁当输入、谁当输出对调，因而对硬件提出相反要求。</p>\n<p>腿足运动里，阻抗控制最直接的用处是<strong>落地缓冲</strong>：摆动腿快要触地时调低刚度，让脚像踩在软垫上一样吸收冲击，再在支撑相调高刚度承重。这把上一篇 MPC 解出的期望足端力，变成关节真正能温和施加的力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接触建模-力估计与混合控制\">接触建模、力估计与混合控制</h2><p>要控力，先得知道力。多数高动态腿足并不在足端装力传感器（易损、增加远端惯量），而是用<strong>关节力矩估计接触力</strong>：在准直驱关节上，电机电流近似正比于力矩，结合腿的雅可比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span> 可由关节力矩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1347em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 反推足端力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">+</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{f} = (J^\\top)^{+}\\boldsymbol{\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1104em;\">f</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.1347em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这种&quot;无传感器力估计&quot;依赖低减速比与精确的关节模型，是高带宽足端力控的关键。</p>\n<p>接触本身难建模：刚性碰撞会激发高频冲击，软地则有连续形变。工程上常用<strong>混合力/位置控制</strong>——把任务空间按方向分解，接触法向控力（踩稳）、切向控位置（不滑移），用选择矩阵切分两类目标。更进阶的整机层面，则把接触力约束直接编进 <a href=\"whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 的 QP：摩擦锥保证不打滑、单边约束保证只压不拉，力控因此与全身优化无缝衔接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"柔顺为何是动态运动的前提\">柔顺为何是动态运动的前提</h2><p>把力控放到整机视角，会发现它不是锦上添花，而是动态腿足的生存条件。原因有三。其一，<strong>抗冲击</strong>：高速落地的冲量若被刚性位置控制硬接，会损坏减速器、激起振动；柔顺让能量被有控地吸收。其二，<strong>地形不确定性</strong>：脚踩到哪里、地有多硬事先不知道，力控让脚&quot;摸着踩&quot;，无需精确地形也能稳定承重，这与 <a href=\"../applications/perception-terrain\">感知与地形适应</a> 的盲走（blind locomotion）能力互补。其三，<strong>安全交互</strong>：人形机器人要在人身边作业、搬运易碎物，可调柔顺让它在碰撞时退让而非顶死。</p>\n<p>正因如此，准直驱+力估计+阻抗控制的组合成为 MIT Cheetah 以降众多高动态平台的标配，也是 <a href=\"learning-locomotion\">学习驱动运动控制</a> 中策略网络常以关节力矩或可变刚度为动作空间的原因——学习出的策略最终也要通过力的柔性施加才能在真实地面存活。</p>\n<h2 id=\"刚度调度-从落地到蹬地的全周期\">刚度调度：从落地到蹬地的全周期</h2><p>腿在一个步态周期里，对柔顺的需求是<strong>随时间变化</strong>的。把足端刚度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按相位调度，是力控在腿足上最实用的落地形式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>相位</th>\n<th>期望行为</th>\n<th>刚度/阻尼策略</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>摆动末段</td>\n<td>预判触地、缓冲</td>\n<td>低刚度、高阻尼</td>\n<td>吸收冲击，避免刚性撞击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触地瞬间</td>\n<td>稳稳承重</td>\n<td>刚度快速上升</td>\n<td>支撑身体、防止塌陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支撑中期</td>\n<td>输出推进力</td>\n<td>高刚度、力跟踪</td>\n<td>蹬地加速，力要忠实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离地前</td>\n<td>快速收腿</td>\n<td>高刚度位置跟踪</td>\n<td>摆脱地面、抬高足端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套&quot;低刚度着陆、高刚度蹬地&quot;的调度，把静态设定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成了随相位切换的函数。它与学习控制天然契合：与其让策略直接输出关节位置，不如让它输出<strong>可变阻抗参数</strong>，由底层阻抗控制器保证力的物理可行性——策略学&quot;该多硬多软&quot;，底层管&quot;力怎么施加&quot;，分工清晰、学习目标更稳。</p>\n<p>另一个不可回避的工程细节是<strong>接触检测的时延</strong>。从足端真正触地到控制器确认接触，总有一段传感与滤波延迟；若在延迟期间仍按摆动相的低刚度处理，脚已经踩实却还在&quot;软着陆&quot;，机会窗口被浪费。因此实际系统常用关节力矩突变、足底加速度等信号做快速接触估计，把相位切换压到毫秒级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>位置控制接触刚硬、力控位置无约束，柔顺控制规定二者间的动态关系来调和。</li>\n<li>阻抗（位置入、力出）与导纳（力入、位置出）是同一关系的两面，对硬件要求相反。</li>\n<li>阻抗控制把末端建模为虚拟弹簧-阻尼，调刚度即可在落地缓冲与精确承重间切换。</li>\n<li>高动态腿足多用关节力矩+雅可比做无传感器足端力估计，依赖低减速比与精确模型。</li>\n<li>混合力/位置控制按方向分解任务，接触力约束可直接编入全身 MPC 的 QP。</li>\n<li>柔顺是动态运动的前提：抗冲击、应对地形不确定、保障人机安全交互。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"力控与柔顺运动","id":"力控与柔顺运动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阻抗与导纳：一枚硬币的两面","id":"阻抗与导纳-一枚硬币的两面"},{"level":2,"text":"接触建模、力估计与混合控制","id":"接触建模-力估计与混合控制"},{"level":2,"text":"柔顺为何是动态运动的前提","id":"柔顺为何是动态运动的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"刚度调度：从落地到蹬地的全周期","id":"刚度调度-从落地到蹬地的全周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"全身控制与 MPC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/whole-body-mpc"},"next":{"title":"学习驱动运动控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/control/learning-locomotion"}}